automaton ping() {
Initialize;
multiple (1..) {
Transmit_Ping;
Receive_Ping;
}
}
This automaton guarantees that the statecalls must initially operate in the following order: Initialize, Transmit Ping, and Receive Ping.

automaton ping() {
Initialize;
multiple (1..) {
Transmit_Ping;
either {
Receive_Ping;
} or {
